                                "sense_id": "ec77a8ff-61bc-3d53-b4c1-004677ad0cd7",
                                "text": "More significantly, rigid deference to Bieber’s still-young core fan base keeps things resolutely PG, with any acknowledgement of sex either couched in vague “touch your body” workarounds or downgraded to desirous hand-holding and eye-gazing."
