                                "sense_id": "abd0f0c1-24ca-36b3-a79a-4248a4f6a2c8",
                                "text": "P&G (PG) wants people who purchased the affected products — which were sold in stores across the United States, as well as online — to throw them away, and the company is offering full refunds."
